==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|Abissinia||archaic}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la-ren|Abyssīnī||the Abyssinians}},<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=Abyssin|pos=n|id=291148|date=2011}}</ref> from {{der|en|ar|الْحَبَشَة}}, from {{m|ar|حَبَش||Abyssinian}}.<ref name=AHD>{{R:American Heritage Dictionary|edition=1971|page=6}}</ref> The humorous use of {{m|en||Abyssinia}} as a parting phrase is due to its phonetic resemblance to ''I'll be seeing ya''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌæb.ɪˈsɪn.i.ə/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˌæb.ɪˈsɪn.i.ə/|/ˌæb.əˈsɪn.i.ə/|/ˌæb.əˈsɪn.jə/|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪniə|s=5}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪnjə|s=4}}

